[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR) vulnerability. This vulnerability arises because the API design allows direct access to image files through their identifiers (`imageId`) without implementing proper access control mechanisms. If the `imageId` is predictable or not sufficiently protected, unauthorized users could potentially access or manipulate images that they should not have permission to view. This lack of robust authorization checks can lead to unauthorized exposure of sensitive or private data.

